    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0199" n="125" xml:id="pg125"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5445</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 21, 1917</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received 10.50 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1420. Diplomatic Commission given hearty welcome this afternoon by Russo-American
                    committee. Speeches made by representatives of Government and by representatives
                    of twelve municipalities and commercial organizations, also by Root and myself.
                    Commission going Moscow to-night.</p>
                <p>Railway Commission working diligently. Will meet Minister Ways Communications at
                    Embassy evening 22d. Stevens improving but slowly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
